    "semantic_summary": "The PromptManager service manages the entire lifecycle of prompt assets, enforcing strict security boundaries around a designated root directory. It provides methods to list, load, save, and delete prompts, utilizing pathlib for reliable filesystem interaction. A critical function, _resolve_prompt_path, prevents directory traversal attacks by verifying that all resolved paths remain within the defined root directory structure."
